  "description": "Bead mw-ju8.13: the Bridgeward College in grey box, built from the e00 kit only. A 16 x 8 m training hall (street door in the south wall, reached by a short entry from briar-glen-lane): the fighting hall in the west half, where Sergeant Maud Garrick (npc-garrick) sells knight-technique lessons from behind her lesson table (garrick-lessons, merchant bridgeward-fighting-hall) with three practice dummies behind her, and the archery butts in the east half, where Master Ewan Rooke (npc-rooke) sells trick-shot lessons (rooke-lessons, merchant bridgeward-archery-butts) with three straw targets behind him. Each table opens the shop screen on its Services tab: a lesson takes its price in crowns and teaches the technique (story bible §5.16). Nobody here teaches sorcery. dev-crowns:600 tops the player up on first opening so the dev scene can pay. Props are kit stand-ins with named marker spawns for art. Reach it with ?scene=bridgeward-college; street-exit leads out to briar-glen-lane (arrive-from-bridgeward-college), and the lane's bridgeward-college-door leads in.",
